  "definition": "Minimum Requirements for Pilot Appointment or Reappointment",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-04-19",
  "historyNote": "#7870, eff 4-12-03; ss by #9891-A, eff 4-1-11; amd by #11159, eff 8-19-16; ss by #12760, eff 4-19-19",
